## Tooling (Terraform)

- `mise install` — terraform + tflint + pre-commit, pinned in `mise.toml`
- `mise run check:lint` — every `lint:` task: `lint:terraform-fmt`, `lint:terraform-validate` (every root module: each directory with a tracked `*.tf` outside `modules/`, or `TF_ROOT_MODULES` under `[env]`; offline, no backend), `lint:tflint` and the repo-wide lints
- `mise run test:fast` — `terraform test` (offline) in each module with a `*.tftest.hcl` · `mise run check` — lint + tests
- `mise run plan [dir]` — `terraform init` + `terraform plan` in one root module (default: the repo root); `mise run apply [dir]` applies it
- Pre-commit runs {% if include_mise %}`lint:terraform-fmt` and `lint:tflint`{% else %}`terraform_fmt` + `terraform_tflint`{% endif %} on commit; tflint config is `.tflint.hcl`.
- State and `*.tfvars` hold secrets — gitignored, never committed. The `.terraform.lock.hcl` lockfile IS committed. Configure the backend per environment.
